        "content": "<p>it's because <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Descriptive.tree#doc\">docs#Descriptive.tree</a> is defined as a <code>CompleteSublattice (Set (List α))</code>, which must be coerced to a type for <code>t : Descriptive.tree α</code> to make sense</p>",
